  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, eres tú.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C002000650072006500730020007400FA002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Supongo que vienes a probar mi entrenamiento\nde alto voltaje.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300750070006F006E0067006F00200071007500650020007600690065006E0065007300200061002000700072006F0062006100720020006D006900200065006E007400720065006E0061006D00690065006E0074006F000A0064006500200061006C0074006F00200076006F006C00740061006A0065002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Las reglas son facilísimas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100730020007200650067006C0061007300200073006F006E00200066006100630069006C00ED00730069006D00610073002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Solo tienes que esquivar los ataques de Pokémon\nsalvajes sin salirte de la zona designada.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peeeeeeeero no se vale usar tus Pokémon para\ncombatir ni lanzar Pokébolas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y como tienes que arreglártelas como sea,\nlo llamé... ¡\"<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Esquiva como puedas<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>\"!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nVen a hablar conmigo si te atreves.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres participar en \"Esquiva como puedas\",\nla experiencia extrema donde deberás esquivar<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nataques sin usar Pokémon ni Pokébolas?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Acepto el reto!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100410063006500700074006F00200065006C0020007200650074006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068006F007200610020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿No te llama la atención por ahora? No importa,\nyo siempre estoy aquí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Crees que podrás aguantar <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>30 segundos<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>\ndesarmad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Te va a encantar la experiencia! ¡Es toda una\ndescarga de electroadrenalina!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En sus marcas, listos...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00200073007500730020006D00610072006300610073002C0020006C006900730074006F0073002E002E002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Fuera!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004600750065007200610021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Se terminó!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300650020007400650072006D0069006E00F30021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Lo lograste!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi quieres intentarlo de nuevo, aquí estaré.\nQuién sabe, tal vez consigas superar tu récord.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAdemás, a mis seguidores les encantó.\nHasta se hizo viral y todo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 183
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, presionaste <U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0004>Sp_1. ¿Acaso quieres rendirte?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
